exports[`exports five artifacts and a strict round-trippable envelope 1`] = `
"# Shopify to NetSuite order-to-cash assurance

Version 0.1.0 · schema 1 · evidence discovery

## Executable: no
- evidence level is discovery
- system shopify evidence rung 1 is below 2
- system netsuite evidence rung 1 is below 2
- system shopify&#95;payments evidence rung 1 is below 2
- attestations not verified against GitHub
- requires 1 distinct verified attestation(s), found 0

## Goals
- Every Shopify order paid in a period is invoiced or cash-saled in NetSuite within 24h (criteria: orders&#95;missing&#95;in&#95;erp == 0 at period close)

## Systems and integration paths
| System | Role | Vendor | API version | Auth | Evidence rung |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| shopify | commerce | Shopify | 2026-07 | oauth&#95;token&#95;exchange | 1 |
| netsuite | erp | Oracle NetSuite | 2026.1 | oauth2&#95;m2m | 1 |
| shopify&#95;payments | payments | Shopify Payments | 2026-07 | inherits:shopify | 1 |

| Path | From | To | Owner | Squire role |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| p1 | shopify | netsuite | existing&#95;vendor&#95;connector | observe&#95;and&#95;propose |

## Ownership
| Entity | Owner | Consumers | Conflict policy |
|---|---|---|---|
| order | shopify | netsuite | source&#95;wins |
| salesorder | netsuite | shopify | source&#95;wins |

## Approval and separation-of-duty requirements
Required distinct approvers: 1. Roles: approver. Separation of duties: true.

A governed write requested by a host-asserted principal is blocked at runtime until a Squire-verified requester re-submits it; executability of this document does not admit such a request.

## Exceptions in scope
| Type | Severity | Disposition | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| missing&#95;in&#95;target | high | propose&#95;create | Paid Shopify order with no NetSuite salesorder after 24h |
| amount&#95;mismatch | medium | propose&#95;correction | Order total differs from salesorder total in minor units |

## Architecture
Squire observes via Shopify webhooks and NetSuite SuiteQL polling; exceptions land in the Reconciliation Center; corrections proposed through guardedWrite

